Subject: [PATCH 22/24] oplus-fwk: add the CryptoEng HAL client and declaration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wire up the OEM cryptoeng (device-attestation) client used by the
cloud-AI attestation path:

  * CryptoEngManager + ICryptoeng client classes.
  * vintf: declare the cryptoeng HAL in the device framework matrix.
  * sepolicy: drop the duplicate cryptoeng daemon labels.

Change-Id: I5d9ea6f12537cf937279031298f41baeb2efee74
(cherry picked from commit 476f0883ec53d6d5f5ff333d37b1e485d7d6cb9e)

Ledger: hardware_oplus.md Accepted Group C row 11 (476f0883)
Stub-matrix: task-9-stub-inventory.md row K05 — consumers: OppoGallery2+AIUnit (manifest uses-library vendor-oplus-hardware-cryptoeng-V1.0 + dex-scan CryptoEngManager/CryptoengNative); attestation chain live-proven; location: oplus-fwk boot jar + vintf device_framework_matrix.xml + sepolicy labels
